        "content": "## Automated Invoice Generation on Job Completion\nToday: First one of 8 people (Ben, Ryan and others) does 'complete job in jobs'; then Emma does 'create invoice in accounts'. This happens about 292 times a month.\nEstimated time saved: 17.49 hours a month (an estimate; see the report).\nRisk: medium - Incorrect invoice amounts or details could lead to billing errors and customer dissatisfaction.\n\nBefore switching on: set the trigger's credentials, ACCOUNTS_API_URL, APPROVAL_WEBHOOK_URL and AI_API_KEY in the n8n environment.",
